1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,981
AI can call a football match.

2
00:00:02,021 --> 00:00:03,525
Can it prove what it says?

3
00:00:03,565 --> 00:00:07,680
CRONISTA is a multi-agent broadcast where
every sentence is traceable.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:16,591
Two LLM coaches, GPT-6 Luna and GPT-5.6 Luna, receive the same
committed observation and return a plan for every player.

5
00:00:16,631 --> 00:00:21,470
A shared deterministic engine resolves the
play; the clock waits for both.

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:33,278
Narrator (goal call): Goooal! Darío Loraránez scores! Club
Pradoalto take the lead, nil–one, after 26 seconds.

7
00:00:33,759 --> 00:00:34,739
Narrator (play-by-play): Owen Sorinón…

8
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:37,266
Narrator (play-by-play): Owen Sorinón shoots!

9
00:00:39,243 --> 00:00:41,398
Narrator (template): Priya, what do you see?

10
00:00:41,438 --> 00:00:45,979
Commentator (LLM, verified): Goal by Darío
Loraránez (11) for Club Pradoalto.

11
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:50,658
The commentator may only analyse with a cited fact.

12
00:00:50,698 --> 00:00:54,755
Eight deterministic rules check
citations, numbers, names and claims.

13
00:00:54,795 --> 00:00:59,030
A failed sentence is retried once, then
replaced by a labelled template.

14
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:06,280
Match stats and each player's numbers are computed only from
confirmed events, live as the broadcast plays.

15
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:16,270
Every line of the commentary can be downloaded,
with its time, voice, evidence and checks.

16
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:25,595
A versioned Microsoft Foundry agent answers viewer questions
with read-only tools over the confirmed play only.

17
00:01:25,635 --> 00:01:27,800
Its sentences pass the same verifier.

18
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:31,540
The same verifier guards the automated recap:

19
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:36,774
click any sentence to see its events and open the
process view with every draft and verdict.

20
00:01:36,814 --> 00:01:39,050
We claim traceability, not better prose.

21
00:01:39,990 --> 00:01:45,593
It runs on Azure Container Apps with Blob, Key Vault,
Application Insights, Speech and Foundry.

22
00:01:45,633 --> 00:01:48,504
More than two thousand automated tests run in CI.

23
00:01:48,544 --> 00:01:49,930
Everything is synthetic.

24
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:52,900
CRONISTA: narrate the match, prove every sentence.
